  "content": "\n\n<h1><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/st35XgD.png\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Если к этому моду приложить достаточно любви, в будущем планируется обновление, добавляющее больше големов.</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eZqO2q0.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moregolems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1452714?logo=curseforge&logoColor=eb622b&labelColor=black&color=eb622b\" alt=\"Скачивания CurseForge\" width=\"161\" height=\"27\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmoregolems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/moregolems?logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=1bd96a\" alt=\"Скачивания CurseForge\" width=\"175\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodderg.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-Read-2ea44f?logo=wikipedia&logoColor=white&style=flat&labelColor=111\" alt=\"Вики\" width=\"131\" height=\"30\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Andresv2017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Andresv2017-6F42C1?logo=github&logoColor=white&style=flat&labelColor=111\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"228\" height=\"31\"></a>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fBrvQ4AWGYu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?url=https://discord.com/api/guilds/1385048182152626296/widget.json&query=presence_count&style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Discord&color=5865F2&labelColor=111\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"33\"></a></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;color:#169179\"><strong>НЕОБХОДИМО ДЛЯ РАБОТЫ:</strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#169179\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1081/393/64/64/638621132937140582.png\" alt=\"Логотип GeckoLib\"></span></strong></a></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">Фотографии для галереи сделал </span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@sir_color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirColor</a></span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">, который записал</span> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X_WgMtKHNHQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">этот потрясающий</a></span> <span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">видеообзор мода!</span></strong></span></p>",
